  "worked_solution": "We need to create a table of values and then sketch the curve. First, we work out the $x$-values using the formula $x=3\\sqrt{t}.$ This gives\n\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $0.25$ | $0.5$ | $0.75$ | $1$ | $1.25$ | $1.5$ | $1.75$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1.5$ | $2.12$ | $2.60$ | $3$ | $3.35$ | $3.67$ | $3.97$ | $4.24$ |\n| $y$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nNow, we work out the $y$ values using $y={t}^{3}-2t.$ This gives\n\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $0.25$ | $0.5$ | $0.75$ | $1$ | $1.25$ | $1.5$ | $1.75$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1.5$ | $2.12$ | $2.60$ | $3$ | $3.35$ | $3.67$ | $3.97$ | $4.24$ |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $-0.48$ | $-0.88$ | $-1.08$ | $-1$ | $-0.55$ | $0.38$ | $1.86$ | $4$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nPlotting these points, we obtain the following curve:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14073429/assets/8897c9d1d91007a51d715d982e6b1137bdc5f83f6ef89802b4115522809d4db5.png)",
